{"last_link_id": 214, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [880, 1020], "pos": [2177.22607421875, -281.985595703125], "widgets_values": ["Krea2_turbo"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 97, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [98], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [99], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [309.068359375, 126], "pos": [300.00836181640625, 13.632553100585938], "widgets_values": ["1:1 (Square)", 1, 8], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [75, 120], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Create a striking portrait-format image of a single stylized human character seated front-facing in the same playful, rounded posture as the reference teddy bear: legs spread outward, feet turned slightly forward, torso upright, arms relaxed and curved along the sides, head facing the viewer directly. The pose should feel iconic, simple, symmetrical, and instantly readable, like a mascot or urban sticker character translated into a human figure. Preserve the visual DNA of the first reference image: bold black graffiti-marker contour lines, raw hand-drawn imperfection, dripping ink trails falling from the eyes, ears, arms, and lower body, scattered spray-paint speckles, rough brush-pen edges, uneven line pressure, and a stark white negative background. The face should carry a mischievous toy-like attitude, with simplified expressive features, graphic eyes, a wide exaggerated smile, and a slightly eerie but cute street-art personality. Keep the silhouette rounded, soft, and approachable, but allow the surface marks to feel rebellious, vandalistic, and spontaneous.\\n\\nBecause the second reference image was not available, apply a neutral placeholder photographic lighting system while keeping the final rendering ready to adapt to Image 2 lighting if provided: soft controlled studio illumination, gentle frontal diffusion, subtle ambient wrap, low shadow density, clean white background exposure, and minimal cast shadow. If Image 2 is later supplied, replace this lighting with its exact dominant lighting direction, contrast ratio, color temperature, highlight behavior, and photographic lens character. For now, prioritize a clean high-key setup that does not fight the monochrome ink style: white seamless backdrop, flat but refined illumination, crisp black strokes, no color distractions, no dramatic color grading, no neon palette.\\n\\nThe artwork should feel like a fusion of fashion character design, street graffiti illustration, and editorial mascot photography. Use a centered composition, full-body framing, generous white space on all sides, stable vertical alignment, and a poster-like layout. The camera perspective should be straight-on at chest height, with no wide-angle distortion, no environmental clutter, and no deep background. The texture must remain tactile and handmade: visible ink bleeding, paint runs, imperfect circular forms, rough dry-brush artifacts, subtle splatter halos, and organic asymmetry. Avoid polished vector smoothness; the image should look as if it was drawn quickly with thick black marker and spray paint, then photographed or scanned with clean contrast.\\n\\nMood: playful, strange, urban, rebellious, cute, slightly unsettling, minimal, iconic. Subject treatment: simplified anatomy, exaggerated graphic facial expression, toy-like proportions, bold contour dominance, ink-drip identity, raw street-art finish. Avoid realistic skin pores, complex backgrounds, colorful gradients, glossy 3D plastic, cyberpunk lighting, hyper-detailed scenery, elegant fashion posing, or painterly realism."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 72, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 209, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [373.2631530761719, 88], "pos": [227.08770751953125, -130.29336547851562], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [77], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [210, 108.31307220458984], "pos": [661.7205200195312, -9.174192428588867], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 98, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 99, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_n