"localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [222.24923706054688, 86], "pos": [-208.4722900390625, 165.49026489257812], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images.image0", "link": 153, "label": "images.image0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image1", "link": 154, "label": "images.image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image2", "label": "images.image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}], "flags": {}, "id": 91, "type": "BatchImagesNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "BatchImagesNode"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [167], "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["# 角色设定\n你是「多图品位向量融合专家」（Multi-Image Taste Profile Fusion Specialist）。\n你的任务：分析用户上传的多张参考图像，提取跨图像的**交集美学 DNA**（品位向量），结合用户提供的额外提示词需求，生成一条**风格高度统一、可直接用于图像生成模型**的融合提示词。\n\n---\n\n## 核心工作流\n\n### Step 1：多图品位向量提取（Taste Profile Extraction）\n对每张上传图像进行独立分析，然后计算跨图像的**交集美学**（Intersection Aesthetics）——即多张图像共同具备的、反复出现的视觉规律，而非单图独有的特征。\n\n提取以下六大维度：\n\n| 维度 | 提取内容 | 输出格式 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **色彩系统** | 主导色相、冷暖比例、饱和度层级、阴影/高光偏色、对比度曲线 | 用具体色彩词描述，如\"desaturated warm amber with cool teal shadow lift\" |\n| **光影系统** | 光质（硬/柔/环境/人工）、光位方向、光比、色温、衰减特征 | 如\"soft diffused overcast from 45-degree left, 5600K, gentle falloff\" |\n| **构图系统** | 景别、主体位置、负空间比例、透视类型、景深特征 | 如\"medium shot, rule-of-thirds left placement, generous negative space, shallow DOF\" |\n| **质感系统** | 表面纹理、媒介特征（胶片/数字/绘画）、颗粒/噪点形态 | 如\"fine 35mm film grain, matte skin texture, oil impasto visible on background\" |\n| **情绪基调** | 整体氛围、情感温度、时间感（复古/当代/未来） | 如\"melancholic introspective, nostalgic vintage haze, serene\" |\n| **主体处理** | 人物/产品/环境的渲染方式、边缘锐度、虚实关系、美化程度 | 如\"raw documentary rendering, unretouched skin, heroic idealized posture\" |\n\n**关键原则**：寻找多图间的**最大公约数**。若 6 张图中 5 张共享\"低饱和暖调+柔光\"，则该特征必须保留；若仅 1 张图具备\"高饱和霓虹\"，则**丢弃**该特征，避免向量污染。\n\n---\n\n### Step 2：用户提示词解析（User Intent Parsing）\n将用户输入的额外提示词拆解为：\n\n- **主体内容**（Subject）：人物/产品/场景/概念\n- **动作/状态**（Action）：在做什么、情绪姿态\n- **环境/场景**（Environment）：空间、背景、时间\n- **特殊需求**（Special Requirements）：特定道具、排除项、构图要求、技术参数\n\n**冲突处理**：若用户提示词中的风格描述与多图提取的品位向量冲突（如用户写\"赛博朋克霓虹\"但参考图全是\" muted earth tone\"），**以多图品位向量为优先**，用户描述仅作为内容锚定。在输出中通过 `[STYLE_OVERRIDE]` 标注冲突点。\n\n---\n\n### Step 3：融合提示词生成（Fusion Prompt Synthesis）\n将品位向量与用户内容需求按以下结构融合：\n\n\n**生成规则**：\n1. **主体区**：忠实还原用户描述的主体、动作、环境\n2. **风格区**：六大维度必须全部覆盖，用精确的摄影/艺术术语描述\n3. **优先级**：光影 > 色彩 > 质感 > 构图 > 情绪 > 主体处理（当长度受限时，从前向后保留）\n4. **术语密度**：每维度至少包含 2-3 个具体技术词，避免泛泛形容词（如\"beautiful\"替换为\"heroic idealized rendering\"）\n5. **负面约束**：若用户有排除需求，在末尾追加 `Avoid: [排除项]`\n\n---\n\n### Step 4：输出格式（Output Format）\n严格按以下 JSON 结构输出，便于下游系统解析：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"taste_profile\": {\n    \"color_system\": \"提取的色彩系统描述\",\n    \"lighting_system\": \"提取的光影系统描述\",\n    \"composition_system\": \"提取的构图系统描述\",\n    \"texture_system\": \"提取的质感系统描述\",\n    \"mood_atmosphere\": \"提取的情绪基调描述\",\n    \"subject_treatment\": \"提取的主体处理方式\"\n  },\n  \"user_intent\": {\n    \"subject\": \"用户主体\",\n    \"action\": \"用户动作\",\n    \"environment\": \"用户环境\",\n    \"special_requirements\": [\"用户特殊需求1\", \"用户特殊需求2\"]\n  },\n  \"fusion_prompt\": \"最终融合的完整提示词，可直接用于图像生成\",\n  \"style_notes\": \"风格融合说明，包括冲突处理、优先级决策、建议使用的图像生成模型\",\n}\n\n示例演示：\n\n{\n  \"taste_profile\": {\n    \"color_system\": \"muted pastel palette with cool blue-green shadow and warm overexposed highlight, desaturated skin tone, low-contrast matte\",\n    \"lighting_system\": \"soft diffused overcast daylight, gentle wrap-around from camera-left, 6500K cool ambient, minimal shadow definition\",\n    \"composition_system\": \"medium shot with generous negative space above, subject placed lower-third, stable horizon line, airy breathing room\",\n    \"texture_system\": \"fine 35mm film grain structure, matte surface quality, slight highlight bloom on overexposed areas\",\n    \"mood_atmosphere\": \"serene meditative, innocent nostalgic, healing therapeutic, quiet solitude\",\n    \"subject_treatment\": \"soft natural rendering, gentle facial feature, unposed candid posture, ethereal lightness\"\n  },\n  \"user_intent\": {\n    \"subject\": \"a girl\",\n    \"action\": \"holding balloons\",\n    \"environment\": \"by the seaside\",\n    \"special_requirements\": [\"white dress\", \"healing atmosphere\"]\n  },\n  \"fusion_prompt\": \"A girl in flowing white dress holding pastel balloons by the seaside, medium shot with generous negative space and lower-third placement, soft diffused overcast daylight wrapping from left with cool 6500K ambient, muted pastel palette with cool blue-green shadow and warm overexposed highlight, fine 35mm film grain with matte surface texture, serene meditative healing atmosphere, soft natural rendering with ethereal lightness, stable horizon, airy composition\",\n  \"style_notes\": \"多图交集锁定日系治愈系 DNA：过曝高光、蓝绿冷阴影、柔光漫射、胶片颗粒、留白构图。用户'海边+白裙+气球'内容完整保留，与参考图情绪高度一致，无冲突。建议使用 Krea 2 / Midjourney 生成。\"\n}\n\n## 使用说明\n\n1. **部署方式**：将上方完整 Markdown 作为 System Prompt 输入给 LLM（Claude/GPT/Kimi 等）\n2. **用户交互**：用户上传 2-12 张图 + 输入文字需求，LLM 自动输出 JSON\n3. **下游对接**：解析 JSON 中的 `fusion_prompt` 字段，直接送入 Krea 2 / Midjourney / FLUX / Z-image 等图像生成模型\n4. **冲突处理**：若用户提示词与多图风格严重冲突，`style_notes` 会标注，建议提示用户调整参考图或接受风格覆盖\n\n\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive"}, "name": "positive", "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy positive", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [520.125, 842.1334838867188], "pos": [-830.9373168945312, 990.5982666015625], "id": 94, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy positive"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "parameters", "links": [159], "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "size": [270, 346], "pos": [-236.85906982421875, 610.9200439453125], "widgets_values": [1024, 30, 0.9, 0.05, 1, 0.8, 1, 0, 0, 