 minimal directional shadows, high-key exposure to eliminate harsh contrast, soft wrap-around fill\",\n    \"composition_system\": \"tight head-and-shoulders portrait, centered framing, direct eye contact gaze, cropped ears and lower body, intimate close-up\",\n    \"texture_system\": \"soft watercolor pigment spread on cold-press paper, visible paper tooth texture, wet-on-wet bleed effects on edges, hand-drawn ink outlines with slight grainy stippling\",\n    \"mood_atmosphere\": \"innocent, whimsical, playful, soft organic warmth, handcrafted artistic feel\",\n    \"subject_treatment\": \"large expressive eyes, simplified anatomical proportions, anthropomorphic character design, soft unsharp edges, hand-painted charm\"\n  },\n  \"user_intent\": {\n    \"subject\": \"a bear character\",\n    \"action\": \"sitting upright with a gentle smile, hands resting naturally\",\n    \"environment\": \"isolated on clean white background\",\n    \"special_requirements\": [\"vivid blue eyes\", \"watercolor ink style\", \"cute but stylish aesthetic\"]\n  },\n  \"fusion_prompt\": \"A bear character sitting upright with a gentle smile and hands resting naturally, tight head-and-shoulders portrait centered on white background. Flat soft frontal studio lighting with high-key exposure to eliminate harsh shadows. Rich earthy ochre and chocolate brown watercolor pigment tones with striking vivid cyan-blue expressive eyes. Visible paper tooth texture with wet-on-wet bleed effects on edges and hand-drawn ink outlines with slight grainy stippling. Innocent whimsical soft organic warmth. Anthropomorphic character design with simplified proportions and soft unsharp edges. Clean white negative space surrounding the subject. Medium resolution suitable for print, soft matte surface quality. Avoid: harsh shadows, digital sharpness, complex backgrounds, realistic fur texture.\",\n  \"style_notes\": \"融合左图涂鸦风格线条与右图水彩质感。以右图的水彩晕染、纸张纹理和蓝眼特征为主导，左图的粗犷线条和坐姿动作作为补充。白色背景统一两图视觉，强调可爱与艺术感的平衡。建议使用 Midjourney v6 或 DALL-E 3 生成，支持水彩效果。\"\n}\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 208, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 111, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.43.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [111.08385618720517, -96.91639623759268], "scale": 0.7247295000000012}}, "groups": [], "links": [[72, 56, 0, 51, 0, "CLIP"], [75, 51, 0, 53, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [77, 52, 0, 53, 3, "LATENT"], [78, 53, 0, 54, 0, "LATENT"], [79, 57, 0, 54, 1, "VAE"], [97, 54, 0, 29, 0, "IMAGE"], [98, 49, 0, 52, 0, "INT"], [99, 49, 1, 52, 1, "INT"], [113, 55, 0, 53, 0, "MODEL"], [120, 51, 0, 77, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [121, 77, 0, 53, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [153, 78, 0, 91, 0, "IMAGE"], [154, 79, 0, 91, 1, "IMAGE"], [159, 97, 0, 95, 1, "LLAMACPPARAMS"], [166, 54, 0, 99, 0, "IMAGE"], [167, 94, 0, 95, 6, "STRING"], [202, 91, 0, 114, 0, "IMAGE"], [203, 78, 0, 115, 0, "IMAGE"], [204, 79, 0, 115, 1, "IMAGE"], [207, 115, 0, 116, 0, "IMAGE"], [208, 95, 0, 111, 0, "*"], [209, 95, 0, 51, 1, "STRING"], [210, 98, 0, 95, 5, "STRING"], [211, 115, 0, 95, 2, "IMAGE"], [212, 117, 0, 95, 0, "LLAMACPPMODEL"]], "id": "08988737-a544-4ab1-99fb-22d67b7c36e3", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 117, "revision": 0}